{"name":"Astral","hex":"#376f89","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"astral","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Relating to or resembling the stars; starry.","Relating to an aster."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A supernatural being from the astral plane."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/astral"}],"entries":[{"title":"Astral body","blocks":[{"text":"The astral body is a subtle body posited by many philosophers, intermediate between the intelligent soul and the mental body, composed of a subtle material. In many recensions the concept ultimately derives from the philosophy of Plato though the same or similar ideas have existed all over the world well before Plato's time: it is related to an astral plane, which consists of the planetary heavens of astrology. The term was adopted by nineteenth-century Theosophists and neo-Rosicrucians."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1c/The_Astral_Sleep_-_by_Jeroen_van_Valkenburg.PNG/330px-The_Astral_Sleep_-_by_Jeroen_van_Valkenburg.PNG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Astral_body"},{"title":"Astral projection","blocks":[{"text":"In esotericism, astral projection is an intentional out-of-body experience (OBE) in which a subtle body, known as the astral body or body of light where consciousness functions separately through from the physical body, travels throughout the astral plane."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/39/GoldFlwr3.gif/330px-GoldFlwr3.gif?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Astral_projection"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/87/Flammarion.jpg/500px-Flammarion.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/87/Flammarion.jpg/1280px-Flammarion.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/87/Flammarion.jpg/500px-Flammarion.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Anonymous Flammarion engraving (1888)","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AFlammarion.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/97/BD_Mummy_and_Ba.jpg/500px-BD_Mummy_and_Ba.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/97/BD_Mummy_and_Ba.jpg/500px-BD_Mummy_and_Ba.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The ba hovering above the body. This image is based on an original found in The Book of the Dead.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABD_Mummy_and_Ba.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b2/SekienIkiryo.jpg/330px-SekienIkiryo.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b2/SekienIkiryo.jpg/330px-SekienIkiryo.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The ikiryō as illustrated by Toriyama Sekien","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASekienIkiryo.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e9/Astral_Body_from_Carrington_and_Muldoon.png/500px-Astral_Body_from_Carrington_and_Muldoon.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e9/Astral_Body_from_Carrington_and_Muldoon.png/500px-Astral_Body_from_Carrington_and_Muldoon.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Astral projection according to Carrington and Muldoon, 1929","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAstral_Body_from_Carrington_and_Muldoon.png"}],"sounds":{"astral":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3d/En-us-astral.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/3d/En-us-astral.ogg/En-us-astral.ogg.mp3"}]}}}